    purpose_en: "The Gardener 2 has demonstrated foundational competency at the Gardener 1 level and is expanding skills across a broader range of maintenance operations and equipment. This role performs maintenance tasks with greater independence, operates a wider range of equipment, and is expected to demonstrate the quality standards that distinguish SWL from competitors. The Gardener 2 is building toward a Lead or Foreman track.",
