    acknowledgment_en: "I acknowledge that I have received, read, and understand the Job Description for my position as Irrigation Technician 2 at SouthWest Landscape.\n\nThis document does not constitute a contract of employment. Employment with SouthWest Landscape remains at-will. SouthWest Landscape reserves the right to modify role responsibilities at its discretion based on business needs.",
